# A组：账号与登录。仅为示例；不会自动执行。
# 将同目录 http-client.private.env.example.json 复制为 http-client.private.env.json。
# 只在私有文件填写账号/密码/密钥和测试对象ID；在IDEA选择coursework-local环境。
# 私有文件已被Git忽略，请不要把真实凭据填进本.http文件。

### A01 账号或手机号密码登录
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginType": "USERNAME",
  "identifier": "{{loginIdentifier}}",
  "password": "{{loginPassword}}"
}

### A02 读取本人身份与IAM权限
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A03 退出该账号全部会话
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A04 修改本人密码
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "{{oldPassword}}",
  "password": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### A05 分页查询范围内用户
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A06 查询一个用户
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A07 创建临时账号
POST {{base}}/api/v1/users/temporary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_temp",
  "realName": "演示外部人员",
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "deptId": "{{deptId}}",
  "password": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### A08 修改临时账号信息
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "realName": "更新后的演示人员"
}

### A09 暂停或恢复临时账号
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 2
}

### A10 管理者重置目标密码
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### A11 检查后端进程
GET {{base}}/api/v1/system/ping

### A12 检查数据库连接
GET {{base}}/api/v1/system/database
